      "writtenOn": "2026-07-15T00:44:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good question! This is pre-existing behavior that was moved rather than introduced in this CL, but under the hood whenVisible uses an IntersectionObserver.\n\nIf the comment doesn\u0027t become visible immediately, the observer callback remains pending until it intersects the viewport. The inline comment notes this fragility: if it becomes visible much later while the user is typing elsewhere, calling textarea?.putCursorAtEnd() could steal focus. If we want to safeguard against focus stealing, we can track this in a follow-up issue/CL.",
